# perl-base is not used by this Flask application -- it's an unused
# transitive dependency of the python:3.11-slim base image, not something
# this app's code ever invokes. Two of these three CVEs have no upstream
# fix available yet (status: affected, no Fixed Version); the third's fix
# is deferred by Debian maintainers, not released. Documented exception,
# same pattern as the Checkov skips elsewhere in this project -- prefer
# the Dockerfile fix (removing the package outright) over relying on this
# file; this exists as a fallback if that ever needs to be reverted.
CVE-2026-13221
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-8376
